{"title":"Skeleton King","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Skeleton King is a named <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> seen at level 6 (mage).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Skeleton King</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Binx Crypt</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-22\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"skeleton-king\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-sword\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8c18e39d797cb940b254.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Sword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Skeletons</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/the-bell-ringer\">The Bell-Ringer</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Skeleton King</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>6</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>mage</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}